PROJECT RULE – API DOCUMENTATION

1. Swagger documentation must be written in src/docs/
2. Every API endpoint MUST have a corresponding Swagger definition file
3. Routes must NOT contain Swagger annotations
4. Swagger files must:
   - Match route paths exactly
   - Include request & response schemas
   - Include security (JWT Bearer) when required
5. An endpoint is considered incomplete if Swagger is missing

Routes and docs must be updated together.
